  <Callout kind="remember">
    A pin rewrites the result and draws a stand-in while the reel moves; it spends one
    turn per <code>spin:allLanded</code>. A BoardGrid is many one-cell reel sets with a
    shared stacking order. Hold &amp; Win is a pure reducer that owns the rules, driven
    by a board that owns the pictures. Keep the rules and the pictures apart and the
    features compose.
  </Callout>
</Architecture>
